'''Moonglade's Edge''' is a sub-location of the [[Moonglade Marsh]].

== Features ==
'''Moonglade's Edge''' is a large field where players can harvest {{Item|Mangrove Log}}s. It also features a launch pad to the {{Zone|Torrhus Canyon}}, as well a broken launch pad.

